+# Frontier self-hosting + hybrid deployment plan (prioritized)
+
+This plan enumerates the tasks and rough sequencing to deploy reliable frontier-model support in Aegis.
+
+Phase A — Managed + Gateway (0–2 weeks)
+- Deploy services/gateway/frontier_router.py behind API gateway (Ingress) as default router.
+- Ensure managed adapter secrets (OpenAI/Anthropic) are present and audited.
+- Start routing traffic to managed adapter for frontier workloads.
+- Implement chargeback logging (ops/telemetry/chargeback_uploader.py).
+
+Phase B — PoC Self-hosted Model (2–8 weeks)
+- Prepare a small frontier model artifact (public checkpoint) and package it.
+- Use deploy/frontier/helm/frontier-chart to deploy PoC.
+- Expose /v1/infer with evidence logging and basic autoscaling via KEDA.
+- Run deploy/deepspeed/benchmark_advanced.py and adjust resource requests.
+- Register model via services/frontier/registry/register_model.py and sign metadata with cosign.
+
+Phase C — Productionize Inference (8–16 weeks)
+- Move from proof-of-concept to production-grade:
+  - Integrate DeepSpeed-Inference or Triton model repo.
+  - Implement tensor/pipeline parallel configs and checkpoint sharding.
+  - Add GPU-aware autoscaler using Prometheus metrics + KEDA.
+  - Harden runtime: runsc RuntimeClass or microVMs, seccomp profile, network isolation.
+
+Phase D — Safety & Governance (concurrent)
+- Expand OPA policies and policy CI for frontier models.
+- Add red-team CI, hallucination detectors, moderation pipeline and watermarking.
+- Implement end-to-end evidence bundles: prompt, seed, model version, outputs + cosign signatures.
+- Legal review of model licenses and sign-off recorded in S3.
+
+Phase E — Scale & Cost Controls (ongoing)
+- Add quotas, token-based cost preflight, cost alerts and chargeback dashboards.
+- Establish runbooks for rollback, auto-isolate, and incident handling.
+
+Deliverables / Tickets (examples)
+- TKT-001: Deploy frontier router and managed adapter default routing
+- TKT-002: Model packaging + metadata registration (cosign)
+- TKT-003: Deploy PoC frontier helm chart and verify /v1/infer
+- TKT-004: Integrate DeepSpeed-inference or Triton path
+- TKT-005: Add KEDA & Prometheus metrics for autoscaling
+- TKT-006: Add full policy CI for frontier model actions
+- TKT-007: HIL & safety testing for agentic use-cases (if frontier drives actuation)
+
